From 1c508c365b02e6655e7a1c74720404b10e09927a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jkabuaufa-tech <jk.abuaufa@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 08:39:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Indonesian (Bahasa Indonesia) to the app, the assistant's
 replies and the car command names

- res/values-in/strings.xml: full Indonesian translation of every string (values-in is the
  qualifier Android resolves for Indonesian on every API level).
- AppLanguageChoice.INDONESIAN and AssistantLanguage.INDONESIAN, shown in both language pickers.
- System prompt: firm-rule and reminder for Indonesian, Indonesian named in the automatic
  language and listening hint, and an instruction to speak natural, everyday Indonesian
  (and understand informal speech) whenever the assistant may answer in it.
- TTS locale, reply-language check, app-name filler words, labelId for all 56 car commands.
- Tests and contributor docs updated to cover the new language.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
